   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "text": "acr said orb while amr said [‘pop’,‘user’,‘mfa’] — a passkey unlock.\nacr answers HOW STRONG; amr answers HOW FRESH, and only amr can tell you.\nThat token may move money and may NOT change the rules.",
