  {
   "id": "t-0149",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1513,
   "y": 650,
   "width": 656,
   "height": 18.8,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "text": "4 · VALIDATED IN THE BACKEND — nine rungs, first failure reported",
   "originalText": "4 · VALIDATED IN THE BACKEND — nine rungs, first failure reported",
   "autoResize": false,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 101050,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 201950,
   "updated": 1731542400000
  },
  {
   "id": "t-0151",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1513,
   "y": 674.5,
   "width": 656,
   "height": 227.5,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "text": "1  malformed_token\n2  bad_signature          ← alg pinned to RS256\n3  wrong_issuer\n4  wrong_audience\n5  expired\n6  assurance_not_accepted ← orb / orb-face\n7  amr_not_accepted       ← face required, mfa forbidden\n8  auth_time_outside_window\n9  not_the_enrolled_treasurer\n\nThe browser never sees the token. The device code never reaches a log,\na response or a public view. The client secret authenticates with Basic\nand never enters a body. alg:none and HS256-signed-with-the-RSA-public-\nkey are both refused, so an unvalidated response is never authorization.",
   "originalText": "1  malformed_token\n2  bad_signature          ← alg pinned to RS256\n3  wrong_issuer\n4  wrong_audience\n5  expired\n6  assurance_not_accepted ← orb / orb-face\n7  amr_not_accepted       ← face required, mfa forbidden\n8  auth_time_outside_window\n9  not_the_enrolled_treasurer\n\nThe browser never sees the token. The device code never reaches a log,\na response or a public view. The client secret authenticates with Basic\nand never enters a body. alg:none and HS256-signed-with-the-RSA-public-\nkey are both refused, so an unvalidated response is never authorization.",
   "autoResize": false,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "boundElements": null,
